  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  HyperArgs
  @  Returns the parameters tagged with their names.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "HyperArgs: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Npv Ksv ndv Xv « Npv 0 + Ksv 0 + ndv 0 + Xv 0 + → Np Ks nd X « Np "Np" →Tag Ks "Ks" →Tag nd "nd" →Tag X "X" →Tag Npv Ksv ndv Xv 4 →List Drop » »
»
